    <rigor-hint>FULL</rigor-hint>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies `.cs` in `Sprk.Bff.Api` (`IncomingAssociationResolver`/`CommunicationService` domain-match logic); corrects a live behavioral bug (writes wrong entity for org association). Behavioral change to the inbound resolver → FULL rigor per CLAUDE.md §8; Step 9.5 gates + publish-size + CVE + placement justification required.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>W0-B</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
